# Implementation Plan: Delivery Confirmation & Escrow Payment Release

This document details the architectural strategy for the **Delivery Confirmation & Escrow Payment Release Module**. This is a critical workflow that empowers the buyer to finalize the supply chain loop by releasing funds to the farmer after successful delivery.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Action Realism vs Simulation:** Similar to previous blockchain actions, the actual Smart Contract interaction to release escrow funds will be simulated with animated loading sequences on the frontend, followed by a database state update on the backend. No real tokens will be transferred on the testnet.
> **Review Workflow Adjustment:** In the previous module, submitting a review triggered the Escrow release. This module properly separates the concerns: the buyer must first explicitly **Confirm Delivery** to release funds, and only then is the **Rating & Review** system unlocked.

